// Scope: corpus regression GUARD — reads live dsl/extdeps/git/git.dag via filesystem_read.
// Asserts the origin/main...HEAD consumer-policy literal is ABSENT: #5059 follow-up dissolved
// ChangedFiles into tools.rust_gates_ci composing DiffNameOnlyMerge directly.
// Goes RED if anyone re-fuses the business ref into extdeps argv.
